      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FESTIVAL RUSH (1) was a Maiden winner (15.84) two back then found trouble in the run and failed to finish at The Gardens last time. Good beginner and aided by the inside draw. Has the ability and can bounce back. FEDERAL SCAMMER (2) jumps from box 2 again after finishing a 5.5 lengths third (17.80) last time at this track over 300m. Good beginner and aided by a handy draw. Expected to feature. TUKO (8) box seated before sticking on well to finish 1.5 lengths away in third (17.65) at this track in a Grade 5 over 300m. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Can feature again. TRALEE VIXEN (3) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
